    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. NeoFilm Pro Subscriptions &amp; Purchases</h2>
  <p>
    NeoFilm provides core film profiles, manual exposure adjustments, and standard photo export free of charge. Users may optionally unlock advanced capabilities ("NeoFilm Pro") via in-app purchases:
  </p>

  <h3>A. Pro Features</h3>
  <p>
    NeoFilm Pro unlocks all 30+ handcrafted film profiles, uncompressed RAW DNG capture on supported hardware, manual focus with live color peaking, darkroom non-destructive reprocessing, unlimited custom recipe saving, and batch photo export.
  </p>

  <h3>B. Purchase Options</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Annual Subscription:</strong> Auto-renewing annual subscription billed once per year.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Monthly Subscription:</strong> Auto-renewing monthly subscription billed month-to-month.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Lifetime Access:</strong> Non-consumable, one-time payment providing permanent access to all Pro features and future profile updates with no recurring fees.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h3>C. Introductory Trial Eligibility</h3>
  <p>
    A seven-day introductory free trial may be made available to eligible annual subscribers. Storefront systems (Apple App Store or Google Play) automatically evaluate your introductory trial eligibility. Unless canceled at least 24 hours prior to the conclusion of the trial period through your store account settings, the trial will automatically transition into a paid recurring annual subscription charged at the then-current storefront price.
  </p>

  <h3>D. Auto-Renewal &amp; Billing</h3>
  <p>
    All subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is disabled at least 24 hours before the conclusion of the active billing cycle. Payment is charged directly to your Apple Account or Google Account upon confirmation of purchase. Prices are displayed in your local currency within the application prior to purchase. We reserve the right to revise subscription pricing; any price adjustments will be communicated by Apple or Google in accordance with their respective storefront policies.
  </p>

  <h3>E. Cancellation &amp; Refunds</h3>
