    You may cancel your subscription at any time. When canceled, your Pro access will remain active until the end of the current paid billing period:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>iOS Users:</strong> Manage and cancel subscriptions via iOS Settings &gt; Apple Account &gt; Subscriptions. Refund requests are subject to Apple’s standard policies via <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Android Users:</strong> Manage and cancel subscriptions via Google Play Store &gt; Profile &gt; Payments &amp; Subscriptions &gt; Subscriptions. Refund requests are governed by Google Play refund policies via <a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/2479637" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play Refund Support</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>F. Restore Purchases</h3>
  <p>
    If you reinstall NeoFilm or upgrade to a new device on the same platform, you can restore your active subscription or lifetime purchase by tapping <strong>Restore Purchases</strong> in the Settings or paywall screen while signed in with the purchasing account.
  </p>

